  m_text: "1. Each player has a deck of <b>Playing Cards.</b>\r\n2. Each card has
    two sides:\r\n\ta. <b>Character Side:</b> Represents a character you can deploy
    to the battlefield.\r\n\tb. <b>Power Side</b>: Provides abilities to enhance
    your strategy (obtained by rotating Character Cards).\r\n3.The battlefield is
    a hexagon-tiled area where battles take place."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
